    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Stress",
     "texto": [
      "In most Polish words of several syllables, the stress falls on the second-to-last syllable. It is a useful pattern, not a rule without exceptions."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Syllables",
     "texto": [
      "**Przedostatnia** means «second-to-last». Count the syllables of the whole word; don't add stress to a single letter."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
